&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;2. Cleanbro k&amp;yacute; kết với c&amp;aacute;c đại l&amp;yacute; ủy quyền tr&amp;ecirc;n to&amp;agrave;n quốc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

